# Applies to image builds that use the repo root as their Docker build context
# (cove-image and cove-item — both reference the shared packages/imgproxy module,
# which lives outside their service directory). cove-api keeps a service-scoped
# context and is unaffected by this file.
#
# Keep the context small: exclude the iOS app, docs, git metadata, CI config,
# and markdown. Only services/ and packages/ are needed by the Go builds.
.git
.github
apps/
docs/
**/*.md
